.²1 To roam or wander about, move or go
 about, rove, ramble (<ab>fig.</ab> also); {#Bramati Buvane kandarpAjYA#} <ls>Māl. 1. 17</ls>;
 {#mano nizWASUnyaM Bramati ca kimapyAliKati ca#} <ls n="Māl. 1.">31</ls>; <ab>oft.</ab> with <ab>acc.</ab>
 of place; {#BuvaM baBrAma#} <ls>Dk.</ls>; {#digmaRqalaM Bramasi mAnasa cApalena#}
 <ls>Bh. 3. 77</ls>; so {#BikzAM Bram#} ‘to go about begging’.
.²2 To turn or whirl round, revolve, move round or in a circle; {#sUryo#}
 {#BrAmyati nityameva gagane#} <ls>Bh. 2. 95</ls>; {#BramatA BramareRa#} <ls>Gīt. 3</ls>.
.²3 To go astray, stray, swerve, deviate.
