 {#Bramati hfdayam#} <ls>Māl. 5. 20</ls>.
.²6 To err, be in error or mistake, be mistaken; {#ABaraRakArastu tAlavya iti baBrAma#}.
.²7 To flicker, flutter, quiver, move unsteadily; {#cakzurBrAmyati#} <ls>Pt. 4. 78</ls>.
.²8 To surround.
